  "description": "In the Joseon Dynasty, evil politics and mysterious cases are plaguing a palace in Hansung. An Inspector takes on the responsibility of stopping these evils from taking over the realm. A mysterious story following an Inspector against the evil forces that are slowly growing in Hansung.\n\n(Source: INKR Comics)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=230110), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1020009356), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/60958391), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/dang_sang), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=2511970), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000055028), [Comico](https://www.comico.kr/comic/8868), [Mootoon](https://www.mootoon.co.kr/comic/moo_list.mg?tcode=jw8v), [Qtoon](https://www.qtoon.co.kr/toon/list.mg?tcode=869o), ZzangComic\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://comics.inkr.com/title/156-secret-inspector)",
